THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This repository is a build driver. It contains no upstream source code; the
toolchains it orchestrates are fetched at pinned commits by ./bootstrap.sh.
The packaging patch under patches/ is a derivative work of the project below
and is distributed under the same terms.

1. LX2000WASD/workbuddy-international-linux
   https://github.com/LX2000WASD/workbuddy-international-linux
   MIT License — Copyright (c) 2026 workbuddy-international-linux contributors
   MIT License — Copyright (c) 2026 Zeongit J. (LICENSE.port-tool)
   Fetched at commit c2b731cf0fa566306c89697ef95c472d17525a93.
   Consumed unmodified: converts the official macOS DMG into a Linux app tree.

2. Xboxpig/workbuddy-desktop-linux
   https://github.com/Xboxpig/workbuddy-desktop-linux
   MIT License — Copyright (c) 2025 ilysenko
   Fetched at commit 66103bafff518ad17a64ca34dbdbee0d2085f4a3.
   Consumed with patches/deb-tool.patch applied: turns the app tree into a
   .deb, and carries the URI-scheme / dependency / WM_CLASS fixes.

3. Electron
   https://github.com/electron/electron
   MIT License. A Linux runtime of the exact version bundled in the DMG is
   downloaded at build time and grafted onto the converted payload.

Neither upstream project is affiliated with Tencent. See DISCLAIMER.md.
